<title>DUBAI: Dubai to free 270 prisoners.</title>
<headline>Dubai to free 270 prisoners.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The crown prince of Dubai on Thursday ordered the release of 270 prisoners, the United Arab Emirates state-run news agency said.</p>
<p>Sheikh Mohammed bin Rashid al-Maktoum, also head of Dubai central police department and UAE defence minister, asked security forces to free them before the end of the Moslem fasting month of Ramadan, around February 10.</p>
<p>The pardon did not include political and drug-related offences.</p>
</text>
